WEBVTT

00:00:02.581 --> 00:00:07.464
Pause, lose the bike, leave or finish: the four ways a class ride stops.

00:00:10.324 --> 00:00:15.337
Pause stops the clock, the plan and the video under one word, Paused. The button

00:00:15.337 --> 00:00:20.287
becomes Resume, the resistance controls stay on, and a screen reader hears each

00:00:20.287 --> 00:00:21.339
change once.

00:00:25.809 --> 00:00:30.444
When the bike stops answering, the ride holds itself. An alert says so, with

00:00:30.444 --> 00:00:35.262
Reconnect. Resume and the resistance controls are off, and Leave stays in reach

00:00:35.262 --> 00:00:36.538
above the alert.

00:00:41.295 --> 00:00:46.575
When the bike is back, by a retry or by Reconnect, the segment's level is sent again

00:00:46.575 --> 00:00:51.023
and the ride carries on. A ride the rider had paused stays paused.

00:00:56.780 --> 00:01:01.444
In Ibiza the course holds still under the same overlay, and the alert says the ride

00:01:01.444 --> 00:01:02.306
is paused.

00:01:07.104 --> 00:01:11.963
Leave opens The Class at once, with no confirmation. At twenty minutes the ride is

00:01:11.963 --> 00:01:16.174
finished. Either way, the bike is sent nothing more for that ride.

00:01:22.590 --> 00:01:25.223
The lost bike, from a phone to a desktop.

00:01:32.913 --> 00:01:37.855
The tests came first. Eight failed, as expected; four passed on the code carried

00:01:37.855 --> 00:01:42.489
over. Now three hundred and fifteen specs and one thousand four hundred and

00:01:42.489 --> 00:01:44.457
forty-five unit tests pass.

00:01:48.399 --> 00:01:54.053
Telo Ride 1, from the Telo family, is the focused edition of Telo Ride: one class,

00:01:54.053 --> 00:01:55.249
nothing else.

00:01:55.594 --> 00:02:00.546
It pairs with a smart bike at home over Bluetooth, plays the class video, or draws

00:02:00.546 --> 00:02:05.558
the Ibiza Sunset Strip course to music if the rider chooses it, and sets the bike's

00:02:05.558 --> 00:02:09.059
resistance for every interval while the rider pedals.

00:02:09.405 --> 00:02:13.380
Connect the bike, take the class, see your number, and come back to beat it.
